      "order": 1,
      "file": "hsk2_sc013_line_001.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "今天空气不错，走快一点儿怎么样？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "file": "hsk2_sc013_line_002.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "可以，不过我最近运动得不多。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "file": "hsk2_sc013_line_003.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "所以先走，不一定要跑。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "file": "hsk2_sc013_line_004.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我以前总觉得运动一定要很累才有效。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "file": "hsk2_sc013_line_005.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "其实每天多走一点儿也很好。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "file": "hsk2_sc013_line_006.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我上班的时候坐得太久。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "file": "hsk2_sc013_line_007.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "那中午和晚上都可以走十分钟。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "file": "hsk2_sc013_line_008.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "这样一天就有二十分钟了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "file": "hsk2_sc013_line_009.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "对，而且不用特别准备。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "file": "hsk2_sc013_line_010.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我喜欢这种简单的方法。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "file": "hsk2_sc013_line_011.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "你周末还可以来公园多走一会儿。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "file": "hsk2_sc013_line_012.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "如果天气好，我想走到湖的另一边。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "file": "hsk2_sc013_line_013.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "那差不多四十分钟。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "file": "hsk2_sc013_line_014.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "正好，不会太短，也不会太累。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "file": "hsk2_sc013_line_015.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "走路的时候也可以听中文。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "file": "hsk2_sc013_line_016.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "好主意，不过有时候我也想什么都不听。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "file": "hsk2_sc013_line_017.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "当然，看看风景也很好。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "file": "hsk2_sc013_line_018.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "今天我就只走路、看风景。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
